  "normalization": "PCAP wall timestamps validated against run interval and microsecond bounds then excluded. DNS forwarding random wire ID must first match the independent actual upstream request/reply witness; only that ID and consequent checksum are canonicalized. Configured fixed client/server/transfer ports prevent hidden endpoint normalization. Keep all IP/UDP header bytes, payloads, record lengths/order/count, file header/metadata and required dump log fields. Runtime TCP control must produce no dump record.",
  "known_deferred": [
    "malformed or oversized wire/header combinations",
    "FIFO pressure beyond ordinary draining consumer",
    "integer-overflow mask grammar combinations",
